  "body": "Positioned at Lot 1, 198 Bucklands Beach Road, this beautifully finished brand-new home delivers an impressive combination of space, contemporary design and everyday versatility in one of East Auckland's most desirable coastal locations.\r\n\r\nDesigned with modern family living firmly in mind, Lot 1 offers generous proportions and a flexible layout that gives everyone room to spread out. Whether you have a growing family, work from home, regularly accommodate guests or simply want the luxury of additional space, this is a home designed to adapt to the way you live both now and in the years ahead.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home is a beautifully appointed designer kitchen connecting effortlessly with the open-plan dining and living areas. Natural light, considered proportions and excellent indoor-outdoor flow create a welcoming environment for everyday family life, while providing an equally impressive setting for entertaining.\r\n\r\nQuality continues throughout, with beautifully finished tiled bathrooms, generous bedroom accommodation, excellent storage and internal-access garaging adding to the practicality of the home. Modern construction and low-maintenance materials also mean you can spend less time on upkeep and more time enjoying everything this exceptional location has to offer.\r\n\r\nPositioned within easy reach of Bucklands Beach and Eastern Beach, with local amenities, transport and Howick Golf Club nearby, the location delivers the coastal lifestyle this area is renowned for. Families will also appreciate being positioned within the highly regarded Macleans College school zone.\r\n\r\nWith Title now issued and the home ready for its next chapter, Lot 1 represents an exciting opportunity to secure a substantial brand-new residence in an established Bucklands Beach community.\r\n\r\nKEY FEATURES\r\n* Brand-new home at Lot 1, 198 Bucklands Beach Road\r\n* Generous and versatile family layout\r\n* Contemporary two-level design\r\n* Quality designer kitchen\r\n* Spacious open-plan living and dining\r\n* Excellent indoor-outdoor connection\r\n* Beautifully finished tiled bathrooms\r\n* Flexible spaces for family, guests or working from home\r\n* Internal-access garaging\r\n* Excellent storage throughout\r\n* Modern, low-maintenance construction\r\n* Title issued\r\n* Stamford 10-year Building Warranty\r\n* Zoned for Macleans College\r\n* Close to Bucklands Beach, Eastern Beach, Howick Golf Club and local amenities\r\n\r\nFIVE BRAND-NEW HOMES. FIVE OPPORTUNITIES.\r\n\r\nLot 1 forms part of an exclusive boutique collection of five brand-new homes at 198 Bucklands Beach Road, with a selection of three to four-bedroom configurations designed to suit different lifestyles and stages of life.\r\n\r\nEach residence offers its own combination of layout, accommodation, outdoor space and functionality. From easy-care options for professionals and downsizers through to larger configurations for growing or established families, buyers have the opportunity to choose the home that works best for them.\r\n\r\nLOT 1 - SPACE & VERSATILITY\r\nThe feature residence, offering generous accommodation and a flexible family-focused layout with the space to grow, entertain, work from home and accommodate guests.\r\n\r\nLOT 2 - MODERN & EASY-CARE\r\nContemporary and practical, offering the benefits of brand-new living with an easy-care approach ideally suited to professionals, couples or young families.\r\n\r\nLOT 3 - THE FAMILY ALL-ROUNDER\r\nA well-balanced configuration combining comfortable bedroom accommodation with generous open-plan living and excellent everyday functionality.\r\n\r\nLOT 4 - FLEXIBILITY FOR THE FUTURE\r\nA versatile layout designed to adapt as life changes, with options for family, guests, working from home or those simply wanting additional flexibility.\r\n\r\nLOT 5 - ROOM TO GROW\r\nGenerous accommodation and contemporary living designed for growing or established families who don't want to compromise on space.\r\n\r\nWith five distinctive homes and a choice of three to five bedrooms, there is an opportunity here for a wide range of buyers.\r\n\r\nContact Simon Davies or Renee Davies to arrange your private viewing of Lot 1 and discover the other homes available within this exclusive Bucklands Beach collection.",
